  "content": "<p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/JaoZZGt.png\" alt=\"Logo\" width=\"1040\" height=\"320\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">這個資源包為您的世界注入了聖誕節的歡樂氣氛，同時保留了預設風格。如果您想要冬季氛圍但不要聖誕節元素，請試試<a style=\"font-size:18px\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/default-style-winter-pack\" rel=\"nofollow\">&nbsp;<strong>預設風格冬季包</strong>！</a></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fentity-model-features\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Entity Model Features</a>、<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fentitytexturefeatures\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Entity Texture Features</a> 和 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fcontinuity\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Continuity</a>（或 Optifine）強烈推薦！</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>內容包含</strong>：</span></p><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\">雲杉樹上的節日燈飾，以及取代鐵柵欄的裝飾（使用 Optifine 可呈現發光紋理！）</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\">薑餅餅乾和拐杖糖甘蔗</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\">可愛的 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.planetminecraft.com%252ftexture-pack%252fcozy-bees%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">暖心蜜蜂</a> 和薑餅苦力怕，由 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.planetminecraft.com%252fmember%252fkobro%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">Kobro</a> 製作</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\">冬日環境（類似冬季包）</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\">可放置的雪人取代牡丹</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\">拐杖糖風格圖形使用者介面</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\">以及更多！</span></li>\n</ul><p><span style=\"font-size:12px\">注意：這是我的 1.11 版本的延續，可在<a style=\"font-size:12px\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/classic-default-style-christmas-pack\" rel=\"nofollow\">此處</a>找到。</span></p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fI3I410P9Q1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"border:0px\" src=\"https://storage.ko-fi.com/cdn/kofi2.png?v=3\" alt=\"在 ko-fi.com 請我喝杯咖啡\" width=\"196\" height=\"36\"></a></p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/4UV0z4K.png\" alt=\"圖片\" width=\"1040\" height=\"320\"></p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/4z8Frx1.png\" alt=\"裝飾\" width=\"1440\" height=\"900\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/B9EYYFG.png\" alt=\"內部\" width=\"1440\" height=\"900\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/U9zTjB5.png\" alt=\"雲杉\" width=\"1440\" height=\"900\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/mEneV0u.png\" alt=\"銀行\" width=\"1184\" height=\"740\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/rGi1bap.png\" alt=\"搭配推薦\" width=\"1040\" height=\"179\"></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">一些與此資源包完美搭配的資源包和用戶端模組！</span>&nbsp;</p><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:large\">[資源包] 🐝&nbsp;<a style=\"font-size:18px\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.planetminecraft.com%252ftexture-pack%252fcozy-bees%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">暖心蜜蜂！</a>：為蜜蜂增添可愛毛衣（需 Optifine）</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:large\">[資源包] 🎅 <a style=\"font-size:18px\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/wearable-christmas-hats\" rel=\"nofollow\">可穿戴聖誕帽</a>：將南瓜模型變為聖誕帽！</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:large\">[資源包] ❄️ <a style=\"font-size:18px\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/soft-weather\" rel=\"nofollow\">柔和天氣</a>：讓雪（和雨）看起來更舒適。</span></li>\n</ul><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/iw1MIpK.png\" alt=\"圖片\" width=\"1040\" height=\"320\"></p><p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/blinking-ender-eyes\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/ZniwvvZ.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"275\" height=\"63\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/baby-animals-remastered\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/B2eR3FW.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"275\" height=\"69\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mob-crates\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/MrkE2a3.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"275\" height=\"69\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/default-style-halloween-pack\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/PwGFKBm.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"275\" height=\"69\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/default-style-fall-pack\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/BehR5p7.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"275\" height=\"69\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/new-default-style-christmas-pack\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/HTdgpYI.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"275\" height=\"69\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/default-style-winter-pack\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/sU8jEWl.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"275\" height=\"69\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mushrooms-plus\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/I44ugv6.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"275\" height=\"69\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/villager-ravager\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/vVFn56b.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"275\" height=\"69\"></a></p><p>模組紋理重製：</p><p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/grappling-hook-mod-3d-retexture\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/bEDnkof.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"275\" height=\"69\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/grappling-hook-mod-retexture\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/gqxSiwm.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"275\" height=\"69\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/smooth-drawers\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/7k0IzpZ.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"275\" height=\"315\"></a></p>",
